MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_001: Hmm...
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_002: Just so you know, these jewels aren't for fashion.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_003: They're an important part of my plan to get my\nfamily back on their feet.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_004: Any money I earn goes into jewels. Makes it easier\nto carry it all with me.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_005: That way, no one can filch 'em. Not without\na fight, anyway.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_006: Doesn't mean they're safe though. Not in this war,\nwhere folks are dying left and right.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_007: Hmm. Hey, Promised One...maybe you could hold on\nto these for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_008: Then if I croak for whatever reason, you can see that\nthey get to my family.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_009: Why not? You're saving the whole world. A little\ndelivery should be a piece of cake.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_010: <NCA>"Live to deliver them yourself."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_011: <NCB>"Your family would rather have you alive."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_012: <ACA>Straight and to the point. That's our Promised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_013: <ACB>Ouch. That's our Promised One—totally merciless,\neven with advice.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_014: Mm.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_015: No, I-I hear you though. Plus, you could die too, so\nit's not a great plan.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_016: I just get overwhelmed sometimes, thinking of how\nhigh the stakes are.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_017: It'd be nice to have some reassurance that things\nwill be fine, even if I don't make it out alive.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_018: <NCA>"I won't let you die."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_019: Ah! The Promised One is gonna keep an eye out for\ncrummy ol' me?
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_020: <NCA>"There's nothing 'crummy' about you."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_021: <NCB>"You're my friend. I care about you."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_022: G-gosh...thanks for that.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_023: Heh... I never knew you thought of me that way.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_A_024: Alright, no more thinking about if I die. Let's start\nthinking of how we'll win!
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_001: What am I doing here? I can't keep deluding myself\nlike this.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_002: Wh... Wait, hold up. Is this real? You're really here?
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_003: You made it!
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_004: <NCA>"Sorry I worried you."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_005: Ahaha. This is so embarrassing. I felt like such an\nidiot waiting around for you.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_006: I can't believe you went and nearly died after telling\nme to live.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_007: <NCA>"Good thing I didn't take those jewels."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_008: <NCB>"I'm fine."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_009: <ACA>Very funny. You're good at a lot of things, but\napparently not jokes.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_010: <ACB>That's all you have to say? "I'm fine"? How can the\nPromised One be this dense?
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_011: I'm glad though. Now I have everything I care about.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_012: Are you curious why I've still got a pile of jewels\nto watch over?
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_013: While you were gone, the rest of us divided up the\nspoils from the war.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_014: My share of them finally put me over the top to\nmake my dream come true.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_015: <NCA>"Congratulations."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_016: Hehe. It didn't feel real until I got to tell you about\nit just now.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_017: I guess I was too preoccupied thinking about you\nfor it to register.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_018: But, yeah, it's happening. My family and I will be\ntogether again.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_019: So I'm headed back home. But what about you?
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_020: <NCA>"I want to see the results of your dream."
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_021: Well, in that case I've got no choice but to let you\ntag along.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_022: <RSDS>Makes sense though. Where else would you go?
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_023: Might as well stay at my place. I'll introduce you to\nthe whole family.
MID_SE_Ism_Lil_S_024: You were part of the dream, after all.